NextAuth v5 split (edge-safe + node)
Credentials: phone-otp, email-password
Argon2id passwords + JWT sessions" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1130" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
