6-digit OTP, 5-min TTL, max 5 attempts
Argon2 hash at rest, single-use
Dev: code printed to log + login toast" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="1130" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
