currentRestaurant() / requireRestaurant()
requireSuperAdmin()
Scopes every admin query to one restaurant" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="1130" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n148" value="orders.ts  (state machine)

Strict transitions: RECEIVED → ACCEPTED → PREPARING
→ READY → OUT_FOR_DELIVERY → DELIVERED
Fires SSE events + notifications + loyalty earn" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="1130" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n149" value="pricing.ts

Subtotal, % / flat coupon (caps), wallet, loyalty
Tax % from Branch · base + per-km delivery
Haversine distance from branch → address" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1480" y="1130" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
