Distance + load + rating scorer
Pluggable RiderScorer interface for ML
suggestRiders() · autoAssign() · assignRider()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="1130" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
