<mxCell id="n217" value="Deployment: single Next.js standalone container + Postgres.  Same image → Vercel / Railway / Render / Fly / AWS / self-hosted Docker.

Arrows:  black = browser→server request  ·  green = HTTP API call  ·  purple = Prisma query  ·  red dashed = external HTTPS  ·  orange double = SSE stream

Auth: phone-OTP (customer/rider) and email+Argon2id (admin/kitchen/super-admin).  Session JWT decoded in edge middleware for RBAC gating.
Multi-tenancy: every admin query filters by currentRestaurant().  Super-admin bypasses tenant scoping for /platform views.
Realtime: in-process bus by default; swap realtime.ts implementation for Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY or Redis to scale horizontally." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1800" y="1830" width="760" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
